# Mosquitto ACL: each identity may only touch its own topics (least privilege).
user mec-backend
topic read campus/+/telemetry
topic read campus/+/emergency
topic write campus/+/ack
topic write campus/+/config
topic readwrite campus/_probe/#

user node1
topic write campus/node1/telemetry
topic write campus/node1/emergency
topic read campus/node1/ack
topic read campus/node1/config
